{"id":"23ac4e7a08867848","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/576_Justification_Logic_JT_45.md","title":"576 Justification Logic JT 45","display":"576_Justification_Logic_JT_45","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{576}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{576}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang},\\operatorname{query}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang},\\operatorname{query}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\\)</span>。显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bang}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{bang}(t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\">\\(!t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{query}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{query}(t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?t\">\\(?t\\)</span>，并显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{just}(t,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{just}(t,A)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\">\\(t:A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{576}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(?t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{576}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}:\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{576}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}:\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项和公式均无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{576}:\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{576}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{576}:\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{576}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜证明变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{576}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{576})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{576},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{576}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{576}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{576})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{576},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{576}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本函数不参与捕获规避，因为本语言无绑定项构造子。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{576}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(?t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(?t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{576}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{576}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{576}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{576}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(?t,\\theta)=?\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(?t,\\theta)=?\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{576}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>捕获规避重命名恒为恒等操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,576}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,576}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{576}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{576}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{576}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{576}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{576}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{576}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{576}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{576}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{576}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{576}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{576}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{576}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{576}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{576}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{576}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{576}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{576}=\\{\\neg(t:A)\\to ?t:(\\neg(t:A)):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{576}=\\{\\neg(t:A)\\to ?t:(\\neg(t:A)):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{576}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{576}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{576}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{576}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{576}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{576}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{576}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{576}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{576}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{576},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{576}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{576}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由项形成和公式形成子句，常元规范中的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\)</span> 都是合法证明项，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>；公理并集、常元证明行和证据条件均使用这个同一集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{576}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{576}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{576}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{576}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列 5 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{576}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{576}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{576}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,576}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,576}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{576}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{576}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{576}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{576}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-JT45-证书\">8. JT45 证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"576\">\\(576\\)</span>-证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,t,A)\">\\((Q,t,A)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{T,4,5\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{T,4,5\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=T\">\\(Q=T\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\to A\">\\(t:A\\to A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=4\">\\(Q=4\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\to !t:(t:A)\">\\(t:A\\to !t:(t:A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=5\">\\(Q=5\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(t:A)\\to ?t:(\\neg(t:A))\">\\(\\neg(t:A)\\to ?t:(\\neg(t:A))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目同时含 T、4、5 三族，并且项语言含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!\">\\(!\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?\">\\(?\\)</span>. 这不同于只含 T 的 JT、只含 4 的 J4 和只含 D/4 的 JD4。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-证据语义载体与后承\">10. 证据语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>原始证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ERaw}_{576}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ERaw}_{576}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{576}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{576}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{576}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{576}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{576}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{576}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{576}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{576}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{576}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{576}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{576}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{576}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{576}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{576}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{576}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{576}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{576}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{576}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{576}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{576}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证据闭包条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EApp}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EApp}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ESum}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ESum}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ETrue}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow M,w\\models_{576}A\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ETrue}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow M,w\\models_{576}A\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EBang}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EBang}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EQuery}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\notin E(w,t)\\Rightarrow \\neg(t:A)\\in E(w,?t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EQuery}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\notin E(w,t)\\Rightarrow \\neg(t:A)\\in E(w,?t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECS}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\\ (M,w\\models_{576}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECS}_{576}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{576}\\ (M,w\\models_{576}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>JT45 证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EviMod}_{576}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{576}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ETrue}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EQuery}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{576}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EviMod}_{576}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{576}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ETrue}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EQuery}_{576}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{576}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{576}^{\\mathsf e}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{576}^{\\mathsf e}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{576}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{576}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{576}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{576}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{576}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{576}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{JT45}_{576}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{576},\\mathsf{PVar}_{576},\\mathsf{PConst}_{576},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{576},\\mathsf{Frm}_{576},\\operatorname{PV}_{576},\\operatorname{TV}_{576},\\operatorname{TVF}_{576},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{576},\\operatorname{freshP}_{576},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{576},\\operatorname{SubT}_{576},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{576},\\equiv_{\\alpha,576},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{576},\\mathsf{Ax}_{576},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{576},\\mathsf{Proof}_{576},\